    "Require a finite first reached unit equal to targetlow16 or NUL. Every reached two-byte read, including terminal-NUL reread, is wholly within genuine live stable determinate readable storage in the same allocation. Earlier nonzero match needs no unused extent or later-NUL promise.",
    "Admit unaligned raw byte storage, prefixes/interior regions and stable read-only aliases. Reached advances by two are nonwrapping and within or one past the same allocation; never read one-past. No typed wchar/WORD ownership, initial alignment, padding, signed cap or copied allocation.",
    "One WORD per visited unit, NUL test first. Nonzero match returns actual borrowed pointer with NO reread. Only unequal nonzero units advance two. NUL ALWAYS causes one separate fresh same-WORD reread including target0, then pointer if reread equals target, null otherwise. No after-NUL or unconditional nonzero-match final read.",
    "Result borrows the genuine allocation lifetime. No payload writes, ownership transfer, SDK wcschr/memcpy/search, byte/dword replacement, provider/global/TLS, fallback, runtime validation, new null guard or Original caller binding.",
    "Exclude null/invalid reached storage, faults, mutation/concurrency, indeterminate bytes, lifetime changes and MMIO/volatile observation protocols. No physical Original ABI/register/home/stack/flags/segment/EH/instruction/bus/fault/runtime/game identity."
  ],
